    Subheading('💡 So...?'),
    Paragraph('Believing in God isn\'t about "blind faith." Logic and common sense actually give strong signs: there is a Designer behind all of this.'),
    Paragraph('And if someone designed a universe this complex, surely He has a purpose? Surely He gives guidance? That\'s what we\'ll cover in the next modules.'),
