    Paragraph('People entrusted him with valuables. Needed a dispute settled? Go to Muhammad. Even his enemies — the ones who later plotted to kill him — still believed he was honest before they knew Islam. Even Abu Sufyan, one of his greatest enemies, when asked by the Romans: "Has he ever lied?" answered: "No."'),
