    Subheading('5️⃣ Belief in the Last Day'),
    Paragraph('Life in this world isn\'t forever. There will be a day when everything ends, and every deed is accounted for. Believing in the Last Day = believing that what you do now has consequences. It makes life more meaningful: not just living for pleasure, but for a long-term purpose.'),
