  'praktik_3.1': <ArticleBlock>[
    Heading('Wudhu: Cleansing Before Standing Before Allah'),
    Paragraph('Before praying, you need to be clean first — not just physically, but also "spiritually" (called being free from minor ritual impurity). How? Wudhu. Here\'s the step-by-step.'),
    Subheading('🛐 Intention in the Heart'),
    Paragraph('The intention lives in the heart; it doesn\'t need to be voiced loudly. Simply in the heart: "I intend wudhu to be free of minor impurity for the sake of Allah." Still, if you want to recite it, that\'s fine too:'),
    EducatorNote('أَشْهَدُ أَنْ لَا إِلَٰهَ إِلَّا اللهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ، وَأَشْهَدُ أَنَّ مُحَمَّدًا عَبْدُهُ وَرَسُولُهُ'),
    Subheading('🪜 Steps of Wudhu (In Order!)'),
    Paragraph('This order must stay in sequence according to the sunnah. If it jumps around, the wudhu is incomplete:'),
