  'why_4.1': <ArticleBlock>[
    Heading('Why Am I Muslim? What Do I Believe In?'),
    Paragraph('Many people grow up Muslim because of family and environment. That\'s not a mistake. But as adults, we deserve to give ourselves a more conscious answer.'),
    Paragraph('Choosing your faith doesn\'t mean resenting the past. In fact, we honor the good inheritance, then examine it honestly: what do I believe, and why do I believe it?'),
    Highlight('"Do not follow that of which you have no knowledge." — QS. Al-Isra 17:36'),
    Paragraph('Asking is not a sign of defiance. An honest question can become a door to learning, as long as we\'re willing to seek answers with humility.'),
    Cta('Write down one question about Islam you\'ve kept all this time. Start looking for its answers, one at a time.'),
  ],
  'why_4.10': <ArticleBlock>[
    Heading('What Does Mature Faith Look Like?'),
    Paragraph('Mature faith doesn\'t mean never doubting, never being wrong, or having the most to say about religion. It means honesty plus good manners.'),
    Highlight('"Indeed, the most noble of you in the sight of Allah is the most mindful of Him." — QS. Al-Hujurat 49:13'),
