    QuizQuestion(question: 'Worship in Islam only means...', options: <String>['It isn\'t only ritual; good deeds count too', 'Praying at the mosque exactly on time', 'Reading only every type of religious book', 'Staying silent and not talking about anything else'], correctIndex: 0, explanation: 'The space of worship is wide when the intention and method are right.'),
    QuizQuestion(question: 'The practical exercise after this article is...', options: <String>['Comparing other people\'s life purposes', 'Delaying all important work', 'Searching for the hardest activity', 'Straightening the intention of one routine activity'], correctIndex: 3, explanation: 'A good intention connects daily activity with a life purpose.'),
